{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53395","headline":"奉赠叶□郎新湖诗 · 汪仲阳","name":"奉赠叶□郎新湖诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平湖近辟千□□，物色如今满面新。\n风摆野花香扑扑，水澄丝柳影鳞鳞。\n高低菡萏分红蘂，出没鵁鶄间白苹。\n回首更看南北岸，不知何处不宜人。\n（以上二首，均爲陶敏先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汪仲阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}